      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُهَذِّبٌ</span></b>  <i>Quick,</i> or <i>swift,</i> [<i>in pace, &amp;c.</i>]. (TA.)
― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">المُهَذِّبُ</span> is also a name of <i>The Devil;</i> who is
also called <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">المُذْهِبُ</span>, meaning “ he who embellishes,

